---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Purix Air Duct & Dryer Vent Cleaning" description="Privacy policy for Purix Air Duct & Dryer Vent Cleaning: how we collect, use and protect the information you share when you contact us. Call us today." breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <PageHeader title="Privacy Policy" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} />
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-x prose-purix max-w-3xl">
      <p><em>Last updated: October 24, 2026</em></p>

      <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>Our website address is: <a href={site.url}>https://purixairductcleaning.com/</a>.</p>
      <p>Purix Air Duct Cleaning is committed to protecting your privacy and handling your personal information responsibly when you visit our website or contact us about our services.</p>

      <h2>2. What Personal Data We Collect and Why</h2>

      <h3>Comments</h3>
      <p>When visitors leave comments on our website, we collect the information provided in the comments form, along with the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help detect spam and protect our website.</p>

      <h3>Media</h3>
      <p>If you upload images to our website, avoid uploading images that contain embedded location data (EXIF GPS). Visitors may be able to download images and extract this information.</p>

      <h3>Contact Forms</h3>
      <p>When you contact us through our website, we may collect your name, phone number, email address, service address, and any information you include in your message. We use this information to respond to inquiries, provide estimates, schedule appointments, deliver air duct cleaning services, and communicate with you about your requests.</p>
      <p>We do not use your contact information for marketing purposes without the appropriate consent where required by law.</p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>Our website may use cookies to improve functionality and user experience. Cookies may remember your preferences, support login functionality, help us understand website traffic, and assist with analytics or advertising where applicable.</p>
      <p>You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. Disabling certain cookies may affect some website features.</p>

      <h3>Embedded Content</h3>
      <p>Pages on our website may include embedded content, such as videos, maps, or other third-party resources. Embedded content from other websites behaves in the same way as if you visited those websites directly.</p>
      <p>These third-party websites may collect data about you, use cookies, and monitor your interaction with their content according to their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>We may use third-party analytics services, such as Google Analytics, to understand how visitors use our website and improve its performance. These services may collect information such as your IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited, and time spent on the website.</p>
      <p>The information collected is used to analyze website traffic and improve our online services, subject to the applicable privacy settings and requirements.</p>

      <h2>3. Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
      <p>We may share relevant information with third-party service providers when necessary to operate our website and provide our services, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Analytics and other analytics providers, where used.</li>
        <li>Spam detection and website security services.</li>
        <li>Email and communication service providers used to respond to inquiries.</li>
        <li>Scheduling, hosting, and other service providers that support our business operations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We may disclose information when required by law or when reasonably necessary to protect our rights, customers, website, or business.</p>

      <h2>4. How Long We Retain Your Data</h2>
      <p>We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, provide our services, maintain business records, resolve disputes, and meet applicable legal obligations.</p>
      <p>If visitors leave comments, the comments and associated metadata may be retained indefinitely to help recognize and approve follow-up comments automatically.</p>
      <p>If our website allows users to register, personal information provided in user profiles will be retained while necessary for account administration and related purposes, unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law.</p>

      <h2>5. What Rights You Have Over Your Data</h2>
      <p>Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Request corrections to inaccurate or incomplete personal information.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal information, subject to legal, contractual, security, and recordkeeping requirements.</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
        <li>Object to or request restrictions on certain types of processing where applicable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us using the contact information provided below. We may need to verify your identity before processing your request.</p>

      <h2>6. Where We Send Your Data</h2>
      <p>Visitor comments may be checked through automated spam detection services. Information submitted through our website may also be processed by third-party hosting, analytics, email, and communication providers as necessary to operate our website and respond to your requests.</p>
      <p>Some service providers may process information outside your state or country. Where required, appropriate safeguards will be applied to such transfers.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, requests, or concerns, please contact us:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Business Name:</strong> Purix Air Duct Cleaning<br />
        <strong>Address:</strong> 1021 Ives Dairy Rd, Ste 212, Miami, FL 33179<br />
        <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={site.phoneHref}>(305) 449-9881</a><br />
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
        <strong>Website:</strong> <a href={site.url}>https://purixairductcleaning.com/</a>
      </p>
      <p>Our business operates 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.</p>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, website functionality, or legal requirements. Any updates will be published on this page with a revised “Last updated” date.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
